OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,F"The biggest transfer of power from
OL,8,FWestminster in a generation" - that's
OL,9,Fwhat the government wants us to take
OL,10,Faway from Andy Burnham's first major
OL,11,Fannouncement on devolution since
OL,12,Fbecoming Prime Minister.
OL,14,FBut what does that actually look like
OL,15,Ffor Yorkshire and Lincolnshire?
OL,17,FWell let's start with the headlines.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FFor the first time, mayors will get a
OL,8,Fshare of income tax revenues - we're
OL,9,Fexpecting that to start in 2028 - and
OL,10,Ffrom spring next year they'll also be
OL,11,Fable to keep a larger share of
OL,12,Fbusiness rates that are generated
OL,13,Flocally.
OL,15,FThere's a new "local first" philosophy
OL,16,Fas part of the announcement, which
OL,17,Fmeans that ministers will have to show
OL,18,Fwhy a power should remain centralised
OL,19,Fin Westminster rather than being
OL,20,Fdevolved to the regions.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FAnd local leaders will get more
OL,8,Fcontrol over transport, housing and
OL,9,Fpublic services among other policy
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,12,FThe idea is that power and money in
OL,13,FEngland is far too centralised - the
OL,14,Finfluential IPPR think tank says that
OL,15,F"for every #1 paid in tax, 96p goes
OL,16,Fstraight to the treasury" - and that
OL,17,Fmayors are best placed to make
OL,18,Fdecisions about local areas and should
OL,19,Fbe supported financially to do that.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FBut this doesn't necessarily mean a
OL,8,Fenlarged chunk of cash for mayors to
OL,9,Fspend, at least not at first.
OL,11,FOver time, the new tax funding will
OL,12,Freplace the existing grants from
OL,13,FWhitehall that make up a significant
OL,14,Fportion of a mayor's budgets.
OL,16,FBut if a region grows then, because of
OL,17,Fhigher revenues from rates and income
OL,18,Ftax, the mayor could find they have
OL,19,Fmore money in their coffers to spend
OL,20,Fon, well, whatever they wanted.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FRegions with lower growth, the
OL,8,Fgovernment insists, will not be left
OL,9,Fbehind as some fear. There is a
OL,10,Fpromise to continue an "equalisation"
OL,11,Fsystem to keep funding fair across the
OL,12,Fcountry but those with the highest
OL,13,Fgrowth look set to benefit the most
OL,14,Ffrom this devolution.
OL,16,FTake a look at the latest growth
OL,17,Ffigures for our region, which are from
OL,18,F2023 so should be treated carefully.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FBack then, according to the ONS, York
OL,8,Fand North Yorkshire had a 'real' GDP
OL,9,Fgrowth of 1.4% (incidentally, that was
OL,10,Fstronger than Andy Burnham's former
OL,11,Fparish of Greater Manchester) while
OL,12,FGreater Lincolnshire's growth was an
OL,13,Fabysmal -1.3%.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FThe government's plan is not just to
OL,8,Fabandon the latter for the former, but
OL,9,Fto give Greater Lincolnshire the tools
OL,10,Fto turn that around while also
OL,11,Fallowing York and North Yorkshire to
OL,12,Fcontinue its growth. At least, that's
OL,13,Fthe idea - how all of that will happen
OL,14,Fis still unclear.
OL,16,FThis money is not ringfinced for
OL,17,Fanything particular so mayors do get a
OL,18,Flarge amount of control over where it
OL,19,Fgoes.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FThat means Andy Burnham is giving new
OL,8,Fpowers to politicians, like Reform
OL,9,FUK's Andrea Jenkyns and Luke Campbell,
OL,10,Fwho may spend these funds in ways he
OL,11,Fwould not.
OL,13,FAlready there is reporting in The
OL,14,FTimes that some mayors are looking to
OL,15,Fuse the new fiscal devolution to bring
OL,16,Fin tax rebate schemes, although the
OL,17,Fgovernment seems to think that is
OL,18,Feasier said than done.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FBut it shows some of the potential
OL,8,Fside effects of devolving more power
OL,9,Fto local areas.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham thinks that
OL,12,Fcentralisation holds us back, that
OL,13,Flocal politicians know what their
OL,14,Fareas need better than someone sitting
OL,15,Fin Westminster.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FThat is the principle behind this
OL,8,Fplan, but the details are less clear,
OL,9,Fespecially when it comes to how much
OL,10,Ftax revenue each area will actually
OL,11,Fget. We are told to expect more about
OL,12,Fall that in the budget.
OL,14,FNevertheless, this is a major step in
OL,15,Fthe region's devolution journey. It
OL,16,Fgives mayors more power and it allows
OL,17,FAndy Burnham to test the vision laid
OL,18,Fout above.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785514721
OL,3,CHow will Burnham's devolution
OL,4,Cannouncement affect Yorkshire and
OL,5,CLincolnshire?
OL,7,FSo when we look back in a few years
OL,8,Ftime, will Burnham's devolution
OL,9,Fhypothesis be proved correct?
OL,11,FOr will this all instead show, as one
OL,12,Fformer senior politician put it to me
OL,13,Frecently, that changing the way
OL,14,Fdecisions are made does not
OL,15,Fnecessarily mean you get better
OL,16,Fdecisions.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/11
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
